# Résumé PDF filename

After every LuaLaTeX compile of `outputs/resume.tex`, the deliverable must be:

`outputs/Baden Morgan Resume.pdf`

Do not use `-jobname` (spaces break aux/log files). Compile as `resume.tex`, copy, then remove the engine PDF so only the named file remains:

```powershell
lualatex -interaction=nonstopmode resume.tex
Copy-Item -Force resume.pdf "Baden Morgan Resume.pdf"
Remove-Item -Force resume.pdf
```

Tell the user the path is `outputs/Baden Morgan Resume.pdf`.
